[00:00.00]Minutes of our class meeting “Contributing to Project Hope” Time: From 10:00 am to 12:00 am on December 17,
[00:11.25]2022 Place: Room 102,
[00:13.53]the Student Recreation Center Present: All members of the class Presided by: Zhang Wei Summary of the meeting I am attaching the minutes of the last class meeting for your review.
[00:32.37]The summary of the meeting on contributing to Project Hope is as follows.
[00:40.08]Firstly,
[00:41.10]moved by the noble cause of Project Hope and encouraged by what has been achieved so far,
[00:50.33]we agreed to contribute our bit to the project by offering financial aid to a senior high student in a remote area of Sichuan Province.
[01:04.36]Secondly,
[01:05.50]we would seek out a girl whose family cannot afford her education.
[01:12.46]Lastly,
[01:13.34]our plan is to pay for her tuition on an annual basis until she graduates from high school.
[01:22.70]If you discover any errors or omissions in the minutes,
[01:28.52]please inform me.
